'''Shin Kyougi''' (Japanese: '''{{ruby|競|きょう}}{{ruby|技|ぎ}}シン''' ''Kyougi Shin'') is a main character in [[Let's Play the Pokémon Card Game! Sun & Moon Arc]]. He is the brother of [[Makoto Kyougi]].

<!--
==Character==
-->
==History==
In [[CSM01]], Shin and Makoto began their first day of school at Ōkido Academy. Despite transferring to the school in hopes of learning how to play the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], Shin and Makoto were forced to do regular school activities all day. Once the day was over, [[Guzumaru]], the teacher, officially started the Pokémon Card Club. Through the use of {{wp|projection mapping}}, any card placed on a student desk would produce a hologram of the Pokémon on the card, allowing for a visual representation of a card battle. As a gift for joining the school, Guzumaru allowed Shin and Makoto to choose one from three {{TCG|Sun & Moon Starter Set}}s. After some difficulty, Shin decided to pick the {{p|Incineroar}}-GX Starter Set Fire while Makoto chose the {{p|Decidueye}}-GX Starter Set Grass. 
